#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:3
msgid "stdfix.h"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:6
msgid "Standards and Goals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:8
msgid ""
"stdfix.h is specified in the `ISO/IEC TR 18037:2008 <https://www.iso.org/"
"standard/51126.html>`_, C extensions to support embedded processors ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:11
msgid ""
"Its `specifications <https://standards.iso.org/ittf/"
"PubliclyAvailableStandards/c051126_ISO_IEC_TR_18037_2008.zip>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:13
msgid ""
"Our goal is to implement a complete set of math functions for fixed point "
"types, most of them are currently not included in the ISO/IEC TR 18037:2008 "
"standard.  Our math functions for fixed point types are modeled after the "
"C99/C23 math functions for floating point types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:20
msgid "Source location"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:22
msgid ""
"The main source for fixed-point functions is located at: ``libc/src/stdfix`` "
"with subdirectories for internal implementations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:27
msgid "Implementation Status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:30
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:32
msgid ""
"In order to build LLVM libc to support fixed-point arithmetics, we need the "
"compiler to support the basic fixed-point types `_Fract` and `_Accum` in C++."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:36
msgid ""
"For the users to be able to use the generated headers, their compiler needs "
"to support `_Fract` and `_Accum` types in C or C++."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:39
msgid ""
"This compiler support is checked at the beginning of `libc/include/llvm-libc-"
"macros/stdfix-macros.h <https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/tree/main/libc/"
"include/llvm-libc-macros/stdfix-macros.h>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:45
msgid "Predefined Macros"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:47
msgid ""
"We use the macro `LIBC_COMPILER_HAS_FIXED_POINT` to specify whether the "
"compiler support the fixed-point types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../headers/stdfix.rst:50
msgid ""
"Other predefined precision macros specified in section 7.18a.3 are defined "
"in `libc/include/llvm-libc-macros/stdfix-macros.h <https://github.com/llvm/"
"llvm-project/tree/main/libc/include/llvm-libc-macros/stdfix-macros.h>`_ "
"using the default configuration of `typical desktop processor` in section "
"A.3."
msgstr ""

